    "O-O"
   ],
   "spoken": "The mindset: don't rush a kingside attack. Bank on the centre and develop each piece to support it, so you never overextend and bite off more than you can chew.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "In broad-centre systems, develop to reinforce the centre first; the attack comes only once it's secure."
  },
  {
